      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9f82b9963becfc64588522"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Our employer has declined to accompany us to [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAthna],Athna]], but the instructions of the [[DM.Factions[faction_NorthwindHighlanders],Northwind Highlanders]] are pretty clear.\n\nOne of their former members has stolen an item from them and we are to recover it by force, if necessary, but highly likely from the contracts' terms.",
