    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9133c273c9787119ecc489"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Really? I met quite a few of the Highlanders when I was temporarily assigned as an [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAstech],astech]] to [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreElgin],Elgin]], where two of their regiments are based.\n\nThey are a pretty tight crowd, what did this character steal to piss them?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 2,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
